    'Shadow opacity': "陰影不透明度",   /* sims.js */
    'Shadows are cast by OSM buildings in view (zoom in past ~z15) and, with the terrain button on, by the real elevation model. Sun path from the SunCalc algorithm; 3D building faces are lit from the sun. The point analysis reads a 360° horizon off the DEM (curvature + refraction) and steps a whole year against it; the irradiance is CLEAR-SKY, not a weather forecast.': "陰影由畫面中的 OSM 建築投下（請放大至約 z15 以上），開啟地形按鈕後也會由實測高程模型投下。太陽軌跡採 SunCalc 演算法；3D 建築面由太陽照明。單點分析會由 DEM 讀取 360° 地平線（含曲率與折射）並推算整年；輻照度為晴空值，不是天氣預報。",   /* sims.js */
    'shaking': "震動",   /* seismic.js */
    'Shallow-water long waves on a spherical staggered grid, with total-depth pressure and Manning bottom friction, solved in a background thread. Depth from the terrarium DEM; initial sea-floor displacement from Okada (1985) summed over a tapered sub-fault grid, with Wells & Coppersmith (1994) fault dimensions and the strike read off the local bathymetric gradient. Cells are tens of kilometers, so this is an open-ocean model: arrival times and deep-water amplitude are meaningful, harbor resonance and run-up are not. Coastal height is a Green’s-law estimate. Educational model — in a real emergency follow the official authorities.': "球面交錯格網上的淺水長波，含全水深壓力項與曼寧底床摩擦，於背景執行緒求解。水深取自 terrarium DEM；初始海底位移採 Okada（1985），並在漸縮的次斷層網格上加總，斷層尺寸採 Wells & Coppersmith（1994），走向由當地海底地形梯度讀出。格子為數十公里，因此屬開放海域模型：到達時刻與深海波幅有意義，港灣共振與溯上則否。沿岸波高為格林定律推估。教育性模型 — 實際災害時請遵從官方指示。",   /* tsunami.js */
    'Shallow-water long waves over the whole ocean; the frames stream in as they are solved.': "全海域的淺水長波；畫面在求解過程中即時串流進來。",   /* atlas-console.js */
